        "intervention_protocol",
        "intervention"
      ],
      "repair_instruction": "Restrict operator_targets to only blocks.0.fc1.weight (or all intended FFN weights) to match the intervention_protocol logic and intervention description. Remove attention weights (blocks.*.attn.*) and input_proj.weight."
