      "finding_id": "F2",
      "code": "claim_overreach",
      "severity": "warning",
      "claim": "The hypothesis and title claim to test 'FFN neuron weight norms' and 'FFN Neuron Capacity Balancing' generally, but intervention_target restricts the regularization to only blocks.0.fc1.weight (first block), leaving the second FFN layer unregularized without justification.",
      "evidence_paths": [
        "hypothesis",
        "title",
        "intervention_target",
        "gap_statement"
      ],
      "repair_instruction": "Either update intervention_target to include blocks.1.fc1.weight to match the general hypothesis, or qualify the hypothesis and title to specify 'First FFN Layer' capacity balancing."
    }
  ]
}

